[#2244] Fix entitlement error response format

The Otto error handler was incorrectly merging headers into the
response body hash. Otto expects handler blocks to return just the
body content - it handles JSON serialization and headers automatically.

Before: {"Content-Type":"...", "X-Entitlement-Required":"...", "body":"..."}
After:  {"error":"...", "entitlement":"...", "current_plan":"..."}

